# Terraform
.terraform/
# NOTE (infra-11): the provider lock is COMMITTED so the Stripe provider version is pinned
# and reproducible between CI validate and any local apply. Do not re-add it here.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# never commit the Stripe key
*stripe*key*
